### Get octocat
GET https://api.github.com/users/octocat
Accept: application/json

### JSON round trip
POST https://httpbin.org/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tool": "VortexPost",
  "local": true,
  "telemetry": false
}

### Auth header pattern (keep tokens in git-managed env files, never in cloud)
GET https://httpbin.org/headers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Client: vortexpost

### Query with variables
GET https://httpbin.org/get?page={{page}}&size=10
